{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o032b","title":"曹泰嗣爵镇东将军转宁陵侯卒曹初嗣","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o032b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"曹泰嗣爵镇东将军转宁陵侯卒曹初嗣","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o032b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0039","role":"嗣爵历官而卒","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o032b-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0042","role":"嗣爵","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o032b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"曹仁卒后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o032b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o032b-q","source_order":[9,139,"O032b"],"order":2192},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o057b","title":"孙权遣吕范拒曹休诸葛瑾潘璋杨粲救南郡朱桓拒曹仁","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o057b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权遣吕范拒曹休诸葛瑾潘璋杨粲救南郡朱桓拒曹仁","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"id":"zhanggu-a-72b4aa81f8e5db981412","label":"裴注·吴录","text":"江陵之围瑾以大兵救援真等退走","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-cd4c4c0a768e466cedd0","label":"正文","text":"权遣将军孙盛督万人备州上，立围坞，为然外救；郃渡兵攻盛，盛不能拒，即时却退；郃据州上围守，然中外断绝","evidence":["zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-957377850a810e671a06","label":"正文","text":"权遣潘璋、杨粲等解〔围〕，而围不解","evidence":["zhulv-q-dd959cac71c7a1159a2e"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-52dadb8ed695bed8e4fc","label":"正文","text":"黄武元年，魏使大司马曹仁步骑数万向濡须；仁欲以兵袭取州上，伪先扬声欲东攻羡溪","evidence":["zhulv-q-150286fc1d8c46dd011b"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-b1986bf47b58704794b1","label":"正文","text":"桓分兵将赴羡溪；既发，猝得仁进军距濡须七十里问；桓遣使追还羡溪兵，兵未到而仁奄至；时桓手下及所部兵在者五千人，诸将业业，各有惧心","evidence":["zhulv-q-3e1cf6b834a280c88d70"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-645ee687e2f216e0d7f4","label":"正文","text":"桓喻诸将曰：两军交对，胜负在将不在众寡；仁非智勇、士卒怯、千里疲困，我共据高城，以逸待劳，为主制客，百战百胜；虽曹丕自来尚不足忧，况仁等邪","evidence":["zhulv-q-e54860898085b1ff7771"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-a484198f8d3e93889209","label":"正文","text":"桓因偃旗鼓，外示虚弱，以诱致仁","evidence":["zhulv-q-9849145c4d07009638e5"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-a4f920dcebc4aed7a72e","label":"正文","text":"仁果遣其子泰攻濡须城；分遣将军常雕督诸葛虔、王双等，乘油船别袭中洲（部曲妻子所在）；仁自将万人留橐皋，复为泰等后拒","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-471f9f1928d4617cde19","label":"正文","text":"桓部兵将攻取油船，或别击雕等；桓等身自拒泰；泰烧营而退，遂枭雕，生虏双，送武昌；临阵斩溺，死者千余","evidence":["zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-4945600b702f75c5bcb0","label":"正文","text":"权嘉桓功，封嘉兴侯，迁奋武将军，领彭城相","evidence":["zhulv-q-021a50d9b1b8fdeac66f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"部署","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0157","role":"拒守","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"救援","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0055","role":"救援","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0027","role":"救援","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0028","role":"拒守","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0038","role":"等围朱然于江陵又分据中州、退走","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0063","role":"同围者","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0046","role":"被围于江陵者","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-sun-sheng-wu","role":"受遣备州上而却退者","evidence":["zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7"]},{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"攻盛据州上者","evidence":["zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"向濡须而扬声者；奄至者；所料之敌（背景）；被诱者（背景）；遣将自留者","evidence":["zhulv-q-150286fc1d8c46dd011b","zhulv-q-3e1cf6b834a280c88d70","zhulv-q-e54860898085b1ff7771","zhulv-q-9849145c4d07009638e5","zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0039","role":"攻濡须城者；烧营而退者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0038","role":"袭中洲者；被枭者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]},{"person":"zhulv-p0018","role":"同袭中洲者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29"]},{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-wang-shuang-captive","role":"同袭中洲者；被生虏者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":222,"label":"秋九月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o054","basis":"秋九月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q","wuzhu-q-o054","guanzhang-q-o034","guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o057b-q","source_order":[47,297,"O057b"],"order":8220},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o063b","title":"曹仁遣常雕曹泰攻朱桓严圭破军魏退","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o063b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"曹仁遣常雕曹泰攻朱桓严圭破军魏退","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"id":"yululu-a-2d3c4a6829607717a85f","label":"正文","text":"黄武初曹仁攻濡须，使别将常雕等袭中洲","evidence":["yululu-q-12e54bb28545c8b8ae82"]},{"id":"yululu-a-34c7a08a16596469b9df","label":"正文","text":"骆统与严圭共拒破常雕等，统封新阳亭侯","evidence":["yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-ren","role":"遣军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0038","role":"进攻","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0039","role":"进攻","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0028","role":"拒守","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0040","role":"破军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0026","role":"拒战受封","evidence":["yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":223,"label":"黄武二年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y223","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o063","basis":"黄武二年"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q","wuzhu-q-o063","zhuge-q-o021","wendi-q-o038","wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o063b-q","source_order":[47,355,"O063b"],"order":8246}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0039","name":"曹泰","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o063","xiahoucao-q-o032","zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o063-wuzhu-p0039","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o063"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o032-wuzhu-p0039","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o032"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。马超的祠墓遗址，相传在今四川成都市新都区城南的马超小学内，曾有墓碑出土。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1fcace810489e51a4218","start":0,"end":56},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o034","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-7ddd1fa08ce5c9feb1d4","layer":"original","quote":"二年卒〖13〗，时年四十七。临没上疏曰：“臣门宗二百余口〖14〗，为孟德所诛略尽〖15〗；惟有从弟岱，当为微宗血食之继〖16〗，深托陛下。余无复言。”","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75},{"id":"wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：黄初四年（公元 223）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":394,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2950ca88709b8c25fb44","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o038","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-62c39b4b73d5f8874468","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“丧乱以来，兵革未戢〖2〗。天下之人，互相残杀。今海内初定，敢有私复仇者，皆族之〖3〗！”筑南巡台于宛。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o057b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-18306c49b308c4280bb8","layer":"original","quote":"权遣吕范等督五军，以舟军拒休等；诸葛瑾、潘璋、杨粲救南郡；朱桓以濡须督拒仁〖11〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":48,"end":90},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o063b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-81e074e42b79f01d129f","layer":"original","quote":"三月，曹仁遣将军常雕等，以兵五千，乘油船〖6〗，晨渡濡须中州；仁子泰，因引军急攻朱桓，桓兵拒之；遣将军严圭等击破雕等。是月，魏军皆退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":122},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o054","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7e0fdf82962252602cbd","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年春正月〖1〗，陆逊部将军宋谦等〖2〗，攻蜀五屯；皆破之，斩其将。三月，鄱阳言黄龙现〖3〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o063","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-81e074e42b79f01d129f","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，曹真分军据江陵中州〖2〗。是月，城江夏山〖3〗。改《四分》〖4〗，用《乾象历》〖5〗。﹝一﹞三月，曹仁遣将军常雕等，以兵五千，乘油船〖6〗，晨渡濡须中州；仁子泰，因引军急攻朱桓，桓兵拒之；遣将军严圭等击破雕等。是月，魏军皆退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o032b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-773f3c70d115ec9d80bb","layer":"original","quote":"子泰嗣，官至镇东将军，假节，转封宁陵侯。泰薨，子初嗣。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":41},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o032","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-773f3c70d115ec9d80bb","layer":"original","quote":"黄初四年薨，谥曰忠侯。﹝一﹞子泰嗣，官至镇东将军，假节，转封宁陵侯。泰薨，子初嗣。又分封泰弟楷、范，皆为列侯。而牛金，官至后将军。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"yululu-q-12e54bb28545c8b8ae82","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"黄武初，曹仁攻濡须，使别将常雕等袭中洲","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":35},{"id":"yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"统与严圭共拒破之，封新阳亭侯","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":36,"end":50},{"id":"zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-f12e0ef1dd328cbd267c","layer":"pei","quote":"曹真、夏侯尚等，围朱然于江陵，又分据中州。瑾以大兵，为之救援。瑾性弘缓，推道理，任计画；无应猝倚伏之术，兵久不解：权以此望之。及春水生，潘璋等作水城于上流；瑾进攻浮桥，真等退走。虽无大勋，亦以全师保境为功","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0dd9b5681971d6dd244a","start":10,"end":112},{"id":"zhuge-q-o021","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-6f9ad1f5d575a9d3f55f","layer":"original","quote":"章武三年春，先主于永安病笃〖1〗；召亮于成都，属以后事。谓亮曰：“君才十倍曹丕，必能安国，终定大事。若嗣子可辅，辅之；如其不才〖2〗，君可自取〖3〗。”亮涕泣曰：“臣敢竭股肱之力〖4〗，效忠贞之节，继之以死！”先主又为诏敕后主曰：“汝与丞相从事〖5〗，事之如父。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135},{"id":"zhulv-q-021a50d9b1b8fdeac66f","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"权嘉桓功，封嘉兴侯，迁奋武将军〖22〗，领彭城相","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":152,"end":176},{"id":"zhulv-q-150286fc1d8c46dd011b","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-90783369b7053954e57c","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年，魏使大司马曹仁步骑数万，向濡须。仁欲以兵袭取州上〖10〗；伪先扬声〖11〗，欲东攻羡溪","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"桓部兵将攻取油船，或别击雕等；桓等身自拒泰。 〔泰〕 烧营而退，遂枭雕〖20〗，生虏双，送武昌。临阵斩溺〖21〗，死者千余","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":90,"end":151},{"id":"zhulv-q-3e1cf6b834a280c88d70","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-90783369b7053954e57c","layer":"original","quote":"桓分兵将赴羡溪；既发，猝得仁进军距濡须七十里问〖13〗。桓遣使追还羡溪兵，兵未到而仁奄至。时桓手下及所部兵，在者五千人；诸将业业〖14〗，各有惧心","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":126},{"id":"zhulv-q-9849145c4d07009638e5","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"桓因偃旗鼓，外示虚弱，以诱致仁","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15},{"id":"zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"仁果遣其子泰攻濡须城；分遣将军常雕督诸葛虔、王双等，乘油船别袭中洲〖17〗。中洲者，部曲妻子所在也〖18〗。仁自将万人留橐皋，复为泰等后拒","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":85},{"id":"zhulv-q-dd959cac71c7a1159a2e","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-6aeea7197e36b0f42123","layer":"original","quote":"权遣潘璋、杨粲等解〔围〕，而围不解","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":72},{"id":"zhulv-q-e54860898085b1ff7771","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f8dfdb59eae673d02fc7","layer":"original","quote":"桓喻之曰：“凡两军交对，胜负在将，不在众寡！诸君闻曹仁用兵行师，孰与桓邪？兵法所以称客倍而主人半者〖15〗，谓俱在平原，无城池之守，又谓士众勇怯齐等故耳。今仁既非智勇；加其士卒甚怯，又千里步涉，人马疲困。桓与诸君，共据高城；南临大江〖16〗，北背山陵；以逸待劳，为主制客：此百战百胜之势也。虽曹丕自来，尚不足忧；况仁等邪","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160},{"id":"zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-6aeea7197e36b0f42123","layer":"original","quote":"权遣将军孙盛，督万人备州上〖1〗，立围坞，为然外救。郃渡兵攻盛，盛不能拒，即时却退。郃据州上围守，然中外断绝","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
